<section style="background:#FDFAF5;padding:120px 64px 100px;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">

    <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px;">
      <span style="display:inline-block;width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);margin-right:10px;"></span>
      About Us
    </div>

    <h1 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,68px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.08;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:64px;">Who we are</h1>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;margin-bottom:64px;">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:20px;">Who We Are</h3>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.78;color:var(--muted);">
          MVG Community Foundation was founded in 2016 by a group of local leaders who saw firsthand the growing gaps in educational access, healthcare, and economic stability. What began as a small volunteer effort has grown into a fully operational nonprofit serving thousands each year.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:20px;">Our Values</h3>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.78;color:var(--muted);">
          We are guided by integrity, compassion, and a deep commitment to equity. Every decision is driven by the needs of the communities we serve, and every dollar raised is invested directly into programs that create measurable, lasting impact.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:48px 56px;background:var(--cream);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);">
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink);">
        "Over the past eight years, MVG Community Foundation has partnered with schools, clinics, local businesses, and government agencies to deliver programs where they are needed most. We operate transparently, publish annual reports, and maintain a volunteer board that reflects the diversity of our community."
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
